      "offset": "BATTLE_039_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "This is Team Three, over.\nWe've driven the fox to a dead-end.\nWe're on the seventh floor,\nI repeat--\n...Huh!?",
